Source: @PKG@
Section: database
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Docker Hardened Images <dhi@docker.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13),
 libssl-dev,
 pkg-config,
 python3
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Homepage: https://redis.io

Package: @PKG@-tools
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Provides: redis-tools
Conflicts: redis-tools
Replaces: redis-tools
Description: Redis command-line interface and utilities
 Redis is an in-memory data structure store used as a database, cache,
 message broker, and streaming engine.
 .
 This package provides redis-cli and redis-benchmark.

Package: @PKG@-server
Architecture: any
Depends: @PKG@-tools (= ${binary:Version}), ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Provides: redis-server, redis
Conflicts: redis-server
Replaces: redis-server
Description: Redis server (in-memory data structure store)
 Redis is an in-memory data structure store used as a database, cache,
 message broker, and streaming engine.
 .
 This package provides redis-server and the redis-check-rdb / redis-check-aof
 helpers.

Package: @PKG@-sentinel
Architecture: any
Depends: @PKG@-server (= ${binary:Version}), ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Provides: redis-sentinel
Conflicts: redis-sentinel
Replaces: redis-sentinel
Description: Redis sentinel high-availability monitor
 Redis is an in-memory data structure store used as a database, cache,
 message broker, and streaming engine.
 .
 This package provides redis-sentinel, the failover monitor for Redis
 replication.
